@prefix is: <http://infiniq.co.kr/2026/industry_safety#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# Classes
is:사업장 a owl:Class .
is:상시근로자 a owl:Class .
is:안전관리자 a owl:Class .

# Object Properties
is:고용하다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:사업장 ;
    rdfs:range is:상시근로자 .

is:선임하다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:사업장 ;
    rdfs:range is:안전관리자 .
